{"total_count":3,"incomplete_results":false,"items":[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nikolife2016/pulsefeed-x402/issues/3","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nikolife2016/pulsefeed-x402","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nikolife2016/pulsefeed-x402/issues/3/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nikolife2016/pulsefeed-x402/issues/3/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nikolife2016/pulsefeed-x402/issues/3/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Nikolife2016/pulsefeed-x402/issues/3","id":5027968008,"node_id":"I_kwDOTQax-M8AAAABK7C0CA","number":3,"title":"radar: 51 ветка ждёт ответа","user":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-actions","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":11683768947,"node_id":"LA_kwDOTQax-M8AAAACuGgqcw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nikolife2016/pulsefeed-x402/labels/radar","name":"radar","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"Threads where our data answers the question","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":true,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":103,"created_at":"2026-07-31T08:41:56Z","updated_at":"2026-10-29T16:13:51Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","active_lock_reason":"spam","sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Свежие вопросы, где у нас есть конкретный ответ — 2026-07-31 UTC\n\n- **[x402-foundation/x402#3006](https://github.com/x402-foundation/x402/issues/3006)** — [Feature]: Privacy-minimal receipt does not bind the payment terms of the accepted offer\n  чем полезны: схемы: в спеке их четыре, и у upto/auth-capture amount — потолок, а не цена; смена получателя и адреса-двойники — у нас есть история наблюдений\n- **[x402-foundation/x402#3005](https://github.com/x402-foundation/x402/issues/3005)** — [Feature]: Bazaar catalogs client-echoed service metadata without server-origin authentication\n  чем полезны: v2 переносит челлендж в заголовок PAYMENT-REQUIRED — тело перестало быть источником; проверка живости: npx x402-payable <url> покажет, где именно ломается\n- **[x402-foundation/x402#3004](https://github.com/x402-foundation/x402/issues/3004)** — [Feature]: auth-capture zero feeRecipient is a wildcard payout authorization that is easy to under-disclose\n  чем полезны: v2 переносит челлендж в заголовок PAYMENT-REQUIRED — тело перестало быть источником; проверка живости: npx x402-payable <url> покажет, где именно ломается\n- **[x402-foundation/x402#3003](https://github.com/x402-foundation/x402/issues/3003)** — [Feature]: Batch-settlement dynamic pricing permits receiver-authorized claims up to the payer-signed ceiling\n  чем полезны: v2 переносит челлендж в заголовок PAYMENT-REQUIRED — тело перестало быть источником; схемы: в спеке их четыре, и у upto/auth-capture amount — потолок, а не цена\n- **[x402-foundation/x402#3001](https://github.com/x402-foundation/x402/issues/3001)** — [Bug]: upto settlement amount is server-declared without protocol-verifiable usage\n  чем полезны: v2 переносит челлендж в заголовок PAYMENT-REQUIRED — тело перестало быть источником; схемы: в спеке их четыре, и у upto/auth-capture amount — потолок, а не цена\n- **[x402-foundation/x402#2997](https://github.com/x402-foundation/x402/issues/2997)** — CDP Bazaar: request delist/deactivate stale resource after endpoint stopped returning 402\n  чем полезны: v2 переносит челлендж в заголовок PAYMENT-REQUIRED — тело перестало быть источником; смена получателя и адреса-двойники — у нас есть история наблюдений\n- **[x402-foundation/x402#2993](https://github.com/x402-foundation/x402/issues/2993)** — Bazaar: a resource can be silently unpayable because its description is too long — document the limit and give\n  чем полезны: v2 переносит челлендж в заголовок PAYMENT-REQUIRED — тело перестало быть источником; проверка живости: npx x402-payable <url> покажет, где именно ломается\n- **[x402-foundation/x402#2978](https://github.com/x402-foundation/x402/issues/2978)** — Proposal: discovery extension — DNS + .well-known records for facilitator discovery\n  чем полезны: схемы: в спеке их четыре, и у upto/auth-capture amount — потолок, а не цена\n- **[14790897/MiQi#528](https://github.com/14790897/MiQi/issues/528)** — [BUG] API 402 Payment Required（余额不足）错误分类缺失，前端显示「内部错误」而非账单提示\n  чем полезны: проверка живости: npx x402-payable <url> покажет, где именно ломается\n- **[Merit-Systems/help-us#10](https://github.com/Merit-Systems/help-us/issues/10)** — StableEnrich: 403 Forbidden on POST /api/fullenrich/people-search (post-payment)\n  чем полезны: v2 переносит челлендж в заголовок PAYMENT-REQUIRED — тело перестало быть источником\n- **[Merit-Systems/x402scan#1045](https://github.com/Merit-Systems/x402scan/issues/1045)** — [Listing Request] code.mamenesia.com — Code Agent x402 v2 on Base (tip-jar $0.01)\n  чем полезны: v2 переносит челлендж в заголовок PAYMENT-REQUIRED — тело перестало быть источником\n- **[naMqe-h/onchain-agent#1](https://github.com/naMqe-h/onchain-agent/issues/1)** — Feature request: opt-in contract-risk context before EVM swap confirmation\n  чем полезны: v2 переносит челлендж в заголовок PAYMENT-REQUIRED — тело перестало быть источником\n\n_Ответ пишется вручную и от лица владельца. Радар только находит ветки; посты он не делает._","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nikolife2016/pulsefeed-x402/issues/3/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nikolife2016/pulsefeed-x402/issues/3/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datafund/swarm_connect/issues/467","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datafund/swarm_connect","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datafund/swarm_connect/issues/467/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datafund/swarm_connect/issues/467/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datafund/swarm_connect/issues/467/events","html_url":"https://github.com/datafund/swarm_connect/issues/467","id":5631913301,"node_id":"I_kwDOQNVw6s8AAAABT7AtVQ","number":467,"title":"x402 on Base mainnet: USDC EIP-712 domain name advertised as \"USDC\" instead of \"USD Coin\"","user":{"login":"crtahlin","id":1554520,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1NTQ1MjA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1554520?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/crtahlin","html_url":"https://github.com/crtahlin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crtahlin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crtahlin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crtahlin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crtahlin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crtahlin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crtahlin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crtahlin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crtahlin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crtahlin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":9566294157,"node_id":"LA_kwDOQNVw6s8AAAACOjIQjQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datafund/swarm_connect/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"d73a4a","default":true,"description":"Something isn't working","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":12012983973,"node_id":"LA_kwDOQNVw6s8AAAACzAeWpQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datafund/swarm_connect/labels/p1","name":"p1","color":"D93F0B","default":false,"description":"High priority — do next","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":12362970136,"node_id":"LA_kwDOQNVw6s8AAAAC4OP0GA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datafund/swarm_connect/labels/audit-2026-09","name":"audit-2026-09","color":"1D76DB","default":false,"description":"Filed from the Sept 2026 gateway audit","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":12362970340,"node_id":"LA_kwDOQNVw6s8AAAAC4OP05A","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datafund/swarm_connect/labels/mainnet-blocker","name":"mainnet-blocker","color":"B60205","default":false,"description":"Must be fixed before x402 takes real money on Base mainnet","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":12362970517,"node_id":"LA_kwDOQNVw6s8AAAAC4OP1lQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datafund/swarm_connect/labels/payments","name":"payments","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"x402 pricing, verification or settlement","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":12545839977,"node_id":"LA_kwDOQNVw6s8AAAAC68pTaQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datafund/swarm_connect/labels/chain","name":"chain","color":"5319E7","default":false,"description":"On-chain anchoring, contracts, RPC, wallets","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":12545840000,"node_id":"LA_kwDOQNVw6s8AAAAC68pTgA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datafund/swarm_connect/labels/integrity","name":"integrity","color":"1D76DB","default":false,"description":"Hashes, signatures, notary, verification","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":4,"created_at":"2026-09-29T14:10:21Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T11:19:45Z","closed_at":"2026-10-22T11:19:45Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"**Problem.** `app/x402/middleware.py` (the `USDC_TOKEN_METADATA` table, around lines 57-66 on `dev`) advertises `extra.name = \"USDC\"`, version \"2\", for network `base`. The Base mainnet USDC contract's EIP-712 `name()` is `\"USD Coin\"`. `\"USDC\"` is correct only on Base Sepolia.\n\n**Impact.** Clients and facilitators build the EIP-3009 signing and verification domain from `extra`. On `X402_NETWORK=base`, signatures made against the advertised domain don't match the on-chain `DOMAIN_SEPARATOR`, so every mainnet payment fails verification. Nothing is lost, because it fails closed, but mainnet payments can't work. Startup validation (#407) doesn't check this value.\n\n**Evidence.** Read-only calls to Base mainnet USDC:\n- `name()` returns `\"USD Coin\"`, `version()` returns `\"2\"`, and `DOMAIN_SEPARATOR` is `0x02fa72…834f`.\n- The separator computed with `\"USDC\"` on chain 8453 doesn't match it; the one computed with `\"USD Coin\"` does.\n\nFound by the 2026-09 client audits. The CLI has the same bug on its side (swarm_provenance_CLI audit, CLI-001), and both must be fixed together.\n\n**Fix (minimal).**\n- Set `name: \"USD Coin\"` for `base`.\n- Add a test pinning both networks' domain separators to the recorded on-chain values.\n- Optionally, at startup on mainnet, compare the configured domain against the chain.\n\n**Acceptance criteria**\n- [ ] The `base` metadata uses `\"USD Coin\"`.\n- [ ] A test pins the Base and Base Sepolia separators.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datafund/swarm_connect/issues/467/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datafund/swarm_connect/issues/467/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/e2b-dev/awesome-ai-sdks/issues/217","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/e2b-dev/awesome-ai-sdks","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/e2b-dev/awesome-ai-sdks/issues/217/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/e2b-dev/awesome-ai-sdks/issues/217/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/e2b-dev/awesome-ai-sdks/issues/217/events","html_url":"https://github.com/e2b-dev/awesome-ai-sdks/pull/217","id":4557932663,"node_id":"PR_kwDOKDzNHs7hGxLA","number":217,"title":"Add AIMarket Agent and AIMarket SDKs (protocol v2)","user":{"login":"alexart2025","id":203622159,"node_id":"U_kgDODCMHDw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/203622159?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexart2025","html_url":"https://github.com/alexart2025","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexart2025/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexart2025/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexart2025/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexart2025/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexart2025/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexart2025/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexart2025/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexart2025/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexart2025/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10897423376,"node_id":"LA_kwDOKDzNHs8AAAACiYl8EA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/e2b-dev/awesome-ai-sdks/labels/cla-signed","name":"cla-signed","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":3,"created_at":"2026-05-31T14:54:11Z","updated_at":"2026-07-29T19:37:46Z","closed_at":"2026-07-29T19:37:46Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/e2b-dev/awesome-ai-sdks/pulls/217","html_url":"https://github.com/e2b-dev/awesome-ai-sdks/pull/217","diff_url":"https://github.com/e2b-dev/awesome-ai-sdks/pull/217.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/e2b-dev/awesome-ai-sdks/pull/217.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"## Summary\nAdds two related SDKs for [AIMarket Protocol v2](https://github.com/alexar76/aimarket-protocol) — federated discovery, HTTP 402 payment channels, safety-gated invoke, and settlement with signed receipts.\n\n| Project | Role |\n|---------|------|\n| [aimarket-agent](https://github.com/alexar76/aimarket-agent) | Python SDK + CLI (`pip install aimarket-agent`) |\n| [aimarket-sdks](https://github.com/alexar76/aimarket-sdks) | Dart (alpha), TypeScript/Rust clients |\n\nReference hub: https://modelmarket.dev\n\n## Why this list\nThese are client libraries for building autonomous agents that discover and pay for capabilities across a federation — aligned with “SDKs for creating and deploying AI agents.”\n\nNot affiliated with e2b; independent open-source (MIT).","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/e2b-dev/awesome-ai-sdks/issues/217/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/e2b-dev/awesome-ai-sdks/issues/217/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0}],"search_type":"lexical"}